Where R3’s audits go. Table 7 shows how each rule spends its audits under its selected attack.
Under R3 the share of the attacker’s jobs that is audited falls from 0.366 at p = 0.01 to 0.190, 0.093,
and 0.042, while under C∗ it moves from 0.363 to 0.292 and under B3 it is 0.251. With the doubled
